{"slug":"dog_end","word":"dog-end","rank":6915,"category":"things","pos":"noun","gloss":"unsmoked end of cigarette","definitions":["A cigarette which has not been smoked to the butt and has been discarded. If one is smoking a dog end, someone else has started the cigarette and discarded it."],"translations":{"bg":[{"w":"фас","r":"fas"},{"w":"угарка","r":"ugarka"}],"fr":[{"w":"mégot","g":"m"}],"it":[{"w":"mozzicone"},{"w":"cicca"}],"ru":[{"w":"бычок","r":"byčok","g":"m"},{"w":"бычки","r":"byčki","g":"m"}]},"otherSenses":[],"alsoSpelled":[],"source":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dog-end"}